#     of the database, never by a Python reader in app/.
#   * Library option objects — docling pipeline options, openpyxl
#     worksheet properties: written here, read by the library.
#   * AIProposalRow — consumed positionally via `dataclasses.astuple`,
#     so no field is ever read by name (see ai_metadata.py).
